      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRACKERJACK KEV (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.3 lengths at The Meadows in a handy 30.66 beating Paw Amalfi. Hard to go past. BREACH (1) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 3.5 lengths sixth (29.12) over 510m at Sale. Comes through a solid form race last start. One of the main contenders. FOXY ROXY (6) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at Geelong in a handy 25.72 beating Rothwell Bonnie. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Sure to measure up. PAW OLENA (2) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Big chance on that form.",
